    'pl.c.plug.p': '<strong>Dynamic loading</strong> via dlopen / LoadLibrary and templated <code>Plugin::load&lt;T&gt;()</code> for <strong>runtime polymorphism</strong>. Compatibility requires equal major versions and a plugin minor version at least as new as the host requirement. The complete <code>VLINK_URL_PLUGINS</code> value selects the mode: case-insensitive <code>auto</code> enables on-demand loading, <code>none</code> or an empty value disables plugins, and any other non-empty value is an explicit preload list.',
