    'bs.c.wheel.p': 'Hashed timing wheel: O(1) insert / delete, ideal for tens of thousands of concurrent timeouts (sessions, heartbeats, keep-alives).',
    'bs.c.elapsed.p': 'High-resolution stopwatch with selectable wall / CPU-active clock source; feeds profiling and task-latency tracking.',
