    'bs.c.schedule.p': 'RAII task-scheduling wrapper: <code>delay_ms</code>, <code>priority</code>, schedule / execution timeouts, with fluent <code>on_then</code> / <code>on_else</code> / <code>on_catch</code> result-callback chaining.',
    'bs.c.bytes.p': 'Unified message carrier: fixed 128-byte object with a 96-byte stack-inline buffer, five ownership modes, built-in LZAV compression and PMR pool allocation.',
    'bs.c.plugin.p': '<strong>Runtime polymorphic plugins</strong> — abstract C++ interfaces implemented in shared libraries, loaded via <code>dlopen</code> / <code>LoadLibrary</code> with ABI and major/minor version checks.',
